                                          ],
                                          "alignItems": "center",
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "type": "text",
                                              "id": "Qeuq8",
                                              "name": "Chapter number",
                                              "fill": "$ink-muted",
                                              "content": "CHAPTER SEVEN",
                                              "fontFamily": "$font-book",
                                              "fontSize": 8.9,
                                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                                              "letterSpacing": 2
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "type": "text",
                                              "id": "vuisU",
                                              "name": "Chapter title",
                                              "fill": "$ink",
                                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                              "width": "fill_container",
                                              "content": "The Orchard Wall",
                                              "textAlign": "center",
                                              "fontFamily": "$font-book",
                                              "fontSize": 24.4,
                                              "fontWeight": "600"
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "d4sKc",
                                          "name": "Paragraph",
                                          "fill": "$ink",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "By the time Ines reached the wall, the apples had begun to fall, thudding into the long grass like small, unhurried knocks.",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                          "textAlign": "justify",
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-book",
                                          "fontSize": 12.2,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "J56V5",
                                          "name": "Paragraph",
                                          "fill": "$ink",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "​　　 She had been told the orchard belonged to no one. Nothing about the gate, rusted open and wound with bindweed, suggested otherwise.",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                          "textAlign": "justify",
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-book",
                                          "fontSize": 12.2,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "Eon7O",
                                          "name": "Paragraph",
                                          "fill": "$ink",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "​　　 Beyond it the trees stood in rows that had once been straight. Salt had stunted them, wind had leaned them all one way, and the grass between them had grown thick enough to hide a path, if there had ever been one.",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                          "textAlign": "justify",
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-book",
                                          "fontSize": 12.2,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "sKtBP",
                                          "name": "Paragraph",
                                          "fill": "$ink",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "​　　 She stood a while with her hand on the stones. They were warm, and rough with lichen, and somewhere on the far side a bird she could not name went on repeating the same four notes, as if it had lost the rest of the song and meant to go on asking for it.",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                          "textAlign": "justify",
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-book",
                                          "fontSize": 12.2,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "Xmziy",
                                          "name": "Paragraph",
                                          "fill": "$ink",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "​　　 Her aunt had said not to go past the wall. She had not said why, and Ines had learned that her aunt's silences were not empty but full, like the cellar at the end of winter, and best left with the door shut. Still, the gate was open, and the apples were falling, and no one had ever told her what to do with an afternoon this long. She put one foot on the lowest stone and then the other, and the wall, which had looked so much",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                          "textAlign": "justify",
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-book",
                                          "fontSize": 12.2,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "pAnou",
                                      "x": 72,
                                      "y": 638,
                                      "name": "Page number",
                                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 316,
                                      "content": "131",
                                      "textAlign": "center",
                                      "fontFamily": "$font-book",
                                      "fontSize": 11.1,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "frame",
                                  "id": "vY3Dj",
                                  "name": "Page 132 (verso)",
                                  "clip": true,
                                  "width": 440,
                                  "height": 680,
